        <activityName xml:lang="en">Disposal, noise barrier wall, ribbed concrete panel</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Disposal, noise barrier wall, ribbed concrete panel
Modern Swiss und European technologies are applied to building machines, material production and building processes. 
UUID: c70c3498-e987-466a-a6d1-cf481270a2d3
1 meter of noise barrier wall installed along the roadside in open terrain.
Total visible height: 3.2 meters, consisting of a ribbed concrete panel with a height of 3.0 meters.
The system boundary includes deconstruction phase (C1), transport phase (C2), treatment/ recycling phase (C3), and final disposal phase (C4) for for one meter of installed noise barrier wall, including excavation, backfilling, and foundation works.
Location: Switzerland
Technology: Based on ASTRA 21001, Fachhandbuch Trassee/Umwelt (FHB T/U),  Lärmschutzwand Freifeld, Betonrippenplatte (ASTRA). Dimensions based on scaled measurement using known reference values.
Time period: Review of data currency scheduled after 5 years.
Production volume: 
Sampling: 
Extrapolations: None
Uncertainty adjustments: None
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_c70c3498-e987-466a-a6d1-cf481270a2d3.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
